{"logId": "c8368524-3910-4b9e-95e2-df5039832bfa", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [847, 135, 1082, 247], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[847.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 247.0], [847.0, 247.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2 这么多人跟着我干，一定要对他们负责，带好他们，就像对待自己的亲人一样！他们时刻感觉到大家庭的温暖总在他们的身边。——关于责任\n3 和一大群志同道合的伙伴们一起，打造一个快乐的团队，用自己辛勤的汗水和聪明智慧，去开创事业、发展事业，创造财富，是件充满激情的事情。——关于团队", "block_bbox": [199, 229, 938, 290], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 229.0], [938.0, 229.0], [938.0, 290.0], [199.0, 290.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [199, 299, 974, 359], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 299.0], [974.0, 299.0], [974.0, 359.0], [199.0, 359.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4 我们的员工致富了吗？怎样打造一个快乐团队？怎样发挥他们的个人潜能？……这是我经常考虑的问题。——关于思考", "block_bbox": [199, 368, 976, 429], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 368.0], [976.0, 368.0], [976.0, 429.0], [199.0, 429.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5 用人不疑，放开，放心让他们大胆去干，用心关爱他们。对于每一个新进入胖东来的人，首先要求必须品质好，心态好，要在各方面严格要求自己，不管做任何事情，都要把公司理念体现出来。——关于用人标准", "block_bbox": [199, 439, 976, 533], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 439.0], [976.0, 439.0], [976.0, 533.0], [199.0, 533.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6 企业文化代表着企业的性格，把企业中每一个人优秀的一面、善良的一面和过去的经验教训汇集起来，经过整理、提炼，形成特色，就像信仰一样，引领大家往好的方面发展。——关于企业文化", "block_bbox": [199, 543, 975, 638], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 543.0], [975.0, 543.0], [975.0, 638.0], [199.0, 638.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7 我从来没有认真地算过给员工发多少钱合适，只是考虑他一年能挣多少钱，办多少事。——关于工资", "block_bbox": [199, 648, 975, 707], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 648.0], [975.0, 648.0], [975.0, 707.0], [199.0, 707.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [243, 724, 571, 975], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[243.0, 724.0], [571.0, 724.0], [571.0, 975.0], [243.0, 975.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [586, 725, 920, 974], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[586.0, 725.0], [920.0, 725.0], [920.0, 974.0], [586.0, 974.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "每年一度的元宵节灯盏", "block_bbox": [485, 981, 663, 1002], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[485.0, 981.0], [662.0, 981.0], [662.0, 1001.0], [485.0, 1001.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [243, 1011, 574, 1239], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[243.0, 1011.0], [574.0, 1011.0], [574.0, 1239.0], [243.0, 1239.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [587, 1012, 920, 1240], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[587.0, 1012.0], [920.0, 1012.0], [920.0, 1240.0], [587.0, 1240.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1001, 609, 1136, 725], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[1001.0, 609.0], [1136.0, 609.0], [1136.0, 725.0], [1001.0, 725.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer", "block_content": "08年致管理人员的一封信", "block_bbo